Package: netease-cloud-music-webkit
Version: 1.0.1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: handsomeme1688-web <hamburgeryummy614@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 (>= 2.36), gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-libav
Homepage: https://music.163.com/st/webplayer
Description: Standalone WebKitGTK desktop wrapper for NetEase Cloud Music
 A small unofficial Ubuntu desktop application that opens the NetEase
 Cloud Music web player in an isolated WebKitGTK window. It does not use
 Google Chrome, Chromium, or Electron. An Internet connection is required.
